{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15221020","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15221020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1522102001:1":{"text":"멀린 님, 저 기억하세요? 세임의 엄마, 칼리스요!","source_cn":"梅林女士，您还记得我吗？我、我是卡莉斯，小赛穆的妈妈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9BC21530FAB94BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1522102002:0":{"text":"지난번에 세임의 열이 내리지 않았을 때 아이를 낫게 해주셨었죠...","source_cn":"上次小赛穆高烧不退，是您出手救了他，治好了他的病……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x640F5C02F36D1F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522102003:0":{"text":"제발 한 번만 더 도와주세요!","source_cn":"求求您，再救他一次吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2F179988B24E275","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1522102003":{"text":"제발 한 번만 더 도와주세요!","source_cn":"求求您，再救他一次吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2F179988B24E275","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522102004:0":{"text":"세임... 기억하고 있어요.\n당신의 품에 안겨있던 그 가여운 아이 말이죠.","source_cn":"小赛穆……我记得他。\\n那可怜的、依偎在你怀中的男孩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C268E5A588589AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522102005:0":{"text":"무슨 병에 걸렸나요?","source_cn":"他生了什么病？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3454CC4A4CACCDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522102006:0":{"text":"모, 모르겠어요... 하지만 평범한 병은 아니에요! 증상이 너무 이상해서 <style=\"highlight\">멀린 님의 마법이 아니면 나을 수 없을 것 같아요</style>!","source_cn":"我、我不知道……但肯定不是普通的病！他病得很诡异，<s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE977EF20E592836A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522102007:0":{"text":"애가 아프면 의사를 찾아가야지, 마법사를 찾아와서 뭐 하나? 당장 돌아가!","source_cn":"孩子生病就该看医生。找这群魔法师有什么用？快回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF09E28100F7DE3F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522102008:0":{"text":"세임을 병원에 데려갈 돈이 어디 있겠어요... 게다가 좋은 의사들은 전부 군의관으로 끌려갔잖아요!","source_cn":"我哪有钱带小赛穆看医生……而且那些好医生都被你们拉去当...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF5B9E2406EFAD2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1522102009:0":{"text":"멀린 님, 제발... 저희 아이 좀 살려주세요!","source_cn":"梅林女士，求求您，求求您救救我的孩子吧——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8DB827DA3EEDE6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522102010:0":{"text":"걱정하지 마세요. 소중한 생명을 외면하지 않을 거예요.","source_cn":"无需忧虑，我不会对一个珍贵的生命袖手旁观。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA3A4504430F5504","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1522102011:0":{"text":"세임은 어디 있나요? 안내해 주시겠어요?","source_cn":"小赛穆现在在哪？请带我们过去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61C257D7CE0CA0DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522102012:0":{"text":"고맙습니다... 고맙습니다!","source_cn":"谢谢……谢谢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A8200F6399E49F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"(초대 멀린을 말없이 바라본다)","source_cn":"（沉默地看向初代梅林）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x08E446620BD8DB48","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(초대 멀린을 말없이 바라본다)","female":"(초대 멀린을 말없이 바라본다)","variant_male_record_index":"77012","variant_female_record_index":"77013","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"(어색하게 물어보려던 말을 삼킨다)","source_cn":"（尴尬地咽回提问的话）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x124D4FBF167EDC7F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(어색하게 물어보려던 말을 삼킨다)","female":"(어색하게 물어보려던 말을 삼킨다)","variant_male_record_index":"77014","variant_female_record_index":"77015","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_t